From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:44:43 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] windows.networking.sockets/tests: test MessageWebSocket
 against a server in the process.

The defaults, the handshake and the information it fills in, messages
both ways in every shape, each way of closing and each way a
connection fails, the connection errors and WebSocketError's reading of
them.  Every expectation was checked on Windows first, where all 238
pass as they do here.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit ee9d50bef60e2937d6963b49bba6545c209321d9)

